# Arc: MagePath | Scene: MagePath11

translate pt strings:

    old "A dagger."
    new "Uma adaga."

    old "A black, oily tongue, emerged from its mouth, sliding around the body of the Mythran prince, and dragging it into its bowels."
    new "Uma língua negra e oleosa emergiu de sua boca, deslizando pelo corpo do príncipe Mythran e arrastando-o para dentro de seu intestino."

    old "A man who knew he had killed himself just the same, but took glee from knowing his enemies would die with him."
    new "Um homem que sabia ter se matado da mesma forma, mas que sentia prazer em saber que seus inimigos morreriam com ele."

    old "Save Samayra."
    new "Salvar Samayra."

    old "Leave her behind."
    new "Deixá-la para trás."
